    {
      "id": "d4924b1b-6954-4807-ac34-7707e2370f3d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "bool konec = false;\n\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003C 10 \u0026\u0026 !konec; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    for(int j = 0; j \u003C 10; j\u002B\u002B)\n    {\n        if (i == 1 \u0026\u0026 j == 3)\n        {\n            konec = true;\n            break;\n        }\n\n        Console.WriteLine($\u0022i = {i}, j = {j}\u0022);\n    }\n}\n\nConsole.WriteLine(\u0022konec vno\u0159en\u00E9ho cyklu\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "i = 0, j = 0\ni = 0, j = 1\ni = 0, j = 2\ni = 0, j = 3\ni = 0, j = 4\ni = 0, j = 5\ni = 0, j = 6\ni = 0, j = 7\ni = 0, j = 8\ni = 0, j = 9\ni = 1, j = 0\ni = 1, j = 1\ni = 1, j = 2\nkonec vno\u0159en\u00E9ho cyklu\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3460f63c-2827-46f6-82e4-41390095d4aa",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Zbytek po celo\u010D\u00EDseln\u00E9m d\u011Blen\u00ED (modulo)\n\nZbytek po celo\u010D\u00EDseln\u00E9m d\u011Blen\u00ED z\u00EDsk\u00E1me pomoc\u00ED oper\u00E1toru modulo \u0060%\u0060.\n\n- 9 % 2 = 9 - (4 * 2) = 1\n- 8 % 2 = 8 - (4 * 2) = 0\n- 1 % 2 = 1 - (0 * 2) = 1\n- 0 % 2 = 0 - (0 * 2) = 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a406f6b-5fc0-4d63-bb77-1f5ac4cd72ab",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "for (int i = 0; i \u003C 10; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    if (i % 2 == 0)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(i);\n    }\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "0\n2\n4\n6\n8\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f70a846-4fce-4ee6-b027-b47c4e96ec16",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Sud\u00E1 \u010D\u00EDsla bych mohl vypsat i pomoc\u00ED n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDho p\u0159\u00EDkladu, kdy v\u00FDraz \u0060i \u002B= 2\u0060 p\u0159i\u010Dte k prom\u011Bnn\u00E9 \u0060i\u0060 hodnotu \u00602\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "68069de6-9e16-484d-86ca-53eb9be444f9",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "for (int i = 0; i \u003C 10; i \u002B= 2)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(i);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "0\n2\n4\n6\n8\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a9d0c8d3-5b90-457d-aede-d528b356a78c",
