      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Spocitejte faktorial cisla n\n// n!\nint n = 6;"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc961723-1958-43d3-89b2-b8eb4680a929",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED 4: Mocnina, kdy z\u00E1klad i exponent jsou kladn\u00E1 \u010D\u00EDsla."
